  "zh": "# 苹果进入库克后时代，中国航天与芯片同日传来捷报\n\n## AI & 科技\n- **Chrome移除旧版扩展UBO**：Google强制推进MV2到MV3迁移，广告拦截生态面临洗牌，UBO用户需尽快更新\n- **苹果AI芯片需求超预期**：Mac Mini和Mac Studio因AI功能热销库存紧张，显示苹果芯片战略正在奏效\n- **手机LED配合AI检测隐藏摄像头**：韩国团队利用LED闪烁和AI算法实现反偷拍，隐私保护有了新利器\n\n## 行业动向\n- **库克卸任苹果CEO**：执掌13年后库克交棒特努斯，苹果正式进入新时代，投资者关注AI战略走向\n- **智神星一号运载火箭首飞成功**：中国商业航天再下一城，可回收技术验证值得关注\n- **长鑫存储毛利率超越海力士美光**：国产存储芯片首次在盈利能力上追平国际巨头，产业突围加速\n- **华为小米荣耀手机集体调价**：开学季前国产旗舰不约而同调价，或为新一代机型让路\n\n## 国际与民生\n- **喜马拉雅冰川消融速度加快65%**：气候危机再响警报，冰川融化将影响20亿人淡水供应\n- **港姐主办方回应颜值质疑**：选美标准争议背后是公众对审美多元化的持续讨论\n- **郑钦文逆转晋级美网次轮**：中国网球一姐延续火热状态，向大满贯冠军发起冲击",
  "en": "# Tim Cook Exits Apple as China Scores Double Win in Space and Chips\n\n## AI & Tech\n- **Google Kills UBO Extension on Chrome Web Store**: MV2 deprecation forces ad-blocker ecosystem shakeup—users must switch to MV3 versions immediately\n- **Apple Mac AI Chip Demand Outpaces Supply**: Mac Mini and Studio flying off shelves due to AI features, revealing Apple's silicon gambit is paying off\n- **Smartphone LEDs Spot Hidden Cameras via AI**: South Korean researchers weaponize phone flash plus AI to detect spy cameras in real-time\n\n## Industry Moves\n- **Tim Cook Bids Farewell to Apple After 13 Years**: Tennus takes the helm as Apple enters a new era—investors eye AI roadmap under new leadership\n- **China's Zhishenxing-1 Rocket Succeeds on Maiden Flight**: Commercial space milestone as Beijing pushes reusable launch technology\n- **ChangXin Memory Outperforms SK Hynix and Micron on Profit Margins**: Chinese chipmaker closes the gap with industry giants, signaling domestic memory breakthrough\n- **Huawei, Xiaomi, Honor Slash Phone Prices Same Day**: Back-to-school season triggers coordinated flagship price cuts, hinting at new model launches ahead\n\n## Global & Society\n- **Himalayan Glaciers Melting 65% Faster**: Climate emergency deepens as glacial loss threatens freshwater for 2 billion people\n- **Hong Kong Miss Pageant Organizers Defend Contestant Looks**: Controversy reignites debate over beauty standards and pageant relevance\n- **Zheng Qinwen Stages Stunning US Open Comeback**: Chinese tennis star advances to round two, keeping Grand Slam title hopes alive"
